# What `docker build` must NOT copy into images. Above all: secrets (.env files) never go in
# an image, where anyone who can pull it could read them. Settings come from the environment
# at run time instead (see docker-compose.yml).
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Rebuilt inside the image, or not needed there
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage
apps/api/src/generated
apps/api/.emails
.git
.github
*.log
